		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "The Push-Up Mystery",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>🏋️ You did a fitness challenge:</p>\n<p>• Week 1 → 10 push-ups<br>\n• Week 2 → 15<br>\n• Week 3 → 20...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>You know you did <strong>600 push-ups in total</strong>,<br>\nbut forgot <strong>how many weeks</strong> it lasted!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>This is an AP where:</strong><br>\n• Sum (Sₙ) is known ✅<br>\n• a and d are known ✅<br>\n• But <strong>n is the mystery</strong> ❓</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Let’s solve it detective-style 🕵️</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "hHbwQLh",
					"buttonText": "Tell me more",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-HgXPp"
				}
			],
			"interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
			"interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "main_message-AJIlE",
			"id": "main_buttons-THokG",
			"flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
			"flowNodePosition": {
				"posX": "992.8932002282995",
				"posY": "-690"
			},
			"isStartNode": false
		},
		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "Mini Quiz",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>📘 <strong>Q. First term = 5, last term = 45, total sum = 400. Find n</strong></p>\n<p>Choose:</p>\n<p><br>\n► A) 16<br>\n► B) 18<br>\n► C) 20</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "📘 Important Question",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "tVQVePM",
					"buttonText": "A",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-BRoWx"
				},
				{
					"id": "dPhzrZU",
					"buttonText": "B",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-MJjVG"
				},
				{
					"id": "vhuGNRt",
					"buttonText": "C",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-MJjVG"
				}
			],
			"interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
			"interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "main_message-LwSpF",
			"id": "main_buttons-HgXPp",
			"flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
			"flowNodePosition": {
				"posX": "1386.4822000380498",
				"posY": "-690.4893953198612"
			},
			"isStartNode": false
		},
		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "❌ That's Incorrect!",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>❌ <strong>Chose B or C?</strong><br>\nLet’s see why they’re off:</p>\n<p>• <strong>If you chose B (18):</strong><br>\n S₁₈ = 9 × (5 + 45) = 9 × 50 = <strong>450</strong> ❌</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>• <strong>If you chose C (20):</strong><br>\n S₂₀ = 10 × (5 + 45) = 10 × 50 = <strong>500</strong> ❌</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🔍 Only <strong>n = 16</strong> gives Sₙ = 400 ✅<br>\nAlways plug the value back into the formula to verify!</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "cnXlttf",
					"buttonText": "Ok, got it",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-wEcqo"
				}
			],
			"interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
			"interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "main_message-NWLEo",
			"id": "main_buttons-MJjVG",
			"flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
			"flowNodePosition": {
				"posX": "1785.2485235488493",
				"posY": "-0.14894386059012277"
			},
			"isStartNode": false
		},
		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "How to Crack ‘n’",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>You have <strong>2 paths</strong> depending on what’s given:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1️⃣ If a and l are given:<br>\n → Use: <strong>n = (2Sₙ) / (a + l)</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2️⃣ If a and d are given:<br>\n → Use: <strong>Sₙ = n/2 · [2a + (n – 1)·d]</strong><br>\n → Rearrange into a <strong>quadratic</strong> and solve</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>⚠️ CBSE Tip:</strong><br>\n• Always check if n is a <strong>whole number</strong><br>\n• If not → recheck steps or inputs</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "HEpVFSU",
					"buttonText": "Ok, got it",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-EpDNP"
				}
			],
			"interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
			"interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "main_message-FPxVk",
			"id": "main_buttons-wEcqo",
			"flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
			"flowNodePosition": {
				"posX": "2276.9473737893977",
				"posY": "-690.90449609093"
			},
			"isStartNode": false
		},
		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "Your next challenge",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>📘 <strong>Q. In an AP, a = 2, d = 3, total sum Sₙ = 245. Find n</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Choose:</p>\n<p><br>\n► A) 10<br>\n► B) 12<br>\n► C) 14</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "📘 Important Question",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "ZtMrWjG",
					"buttonText": "A",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-xxOLE"
				},
				{
					"id": "lxeIqxp",
					"buttonText": "B",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-xxOLE"
				},
				{
					"id": "IVRtfvD",
					"buttonText": "C",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-ZtyRr"
				}
			],
			"interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
			"interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "main_message-JPEkf",
			"id": "main_buttons-EpDNP",
			"flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
			"flowNodePosition": {
				"posX": "2669.7372707175678",
				"posY": "-698.172883809983"
			},
			"isStartNode": false
		},
		{
			"interactiveButtonsHeader": {
				"type": "Text",
				"text": "✅  That's Correct!",
				"media": null
			},
			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>✅ <strong>Correct Answer: C) 14</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>📐 Let’s solve:</strong></p>\n<p>Use: Sₙ = n/2 · [2a + (n – 1)·d]<br>\n→ 245 = n/2 × [4 + 3(n – 1)]<br>\n→ 245 = n/2 × (3n + 1)<br>\n→ 490 = n(3n + 1)<br>\n→ 3n² + n – 490 = 0</p>\n<p><br>\n→ Solve the quadratic: n = ✅ 14</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🧠 Tip: Factor or use quadratic formula when needed!</p>",
			"interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
			"interactiveButtonsItems": [
				{
					"id": "glDppKD",
					"buttonText": "Ok, got it",
					"nodeResultId": "main_buttons-CVswx"
				}
			],
