			"interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>❌ <strong>Chose A or B?</strong></p>\n<p><br>\nLet’s debug it 🔍</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Option A (n = 10):</strong><br>\n S₁₀ = 5 × [2×2 + 9×3] = 5 × (4 + 27) = 5 × 31 = <strong>155</strong> ❌•&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Option B (n = 12):</strong><br>\n S₁₂ = 6 × [2×2 + 11×3] = 6 × (4 + 33) = 6 × 37 = <strong>222</strong> ❌</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🔁 Only <strong>n = 14</strong> gives:<br>\nS₁₄ = 7 × [2×2 + 13×3] = 7 × (4 + 39) = 7 × 43 = ✅ <strong>245</strong>📌</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;Always verify your answer by <strong>plugging n back</strong> into the formula!Ask ChatGPT</p>",
